{"id":"nhc_school_spine_2021","title":"儿童青少年脊柱弯曲异常防控：学校筛查与转诊","publisher":"国家卫生健康委","source_url":"https://www.nhc.gov.cn/jkj/c100062/202111/fbb103397fab4a1c9541bdcf3988dad6.shtml","source_date":"2021-11-01","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"public_health_guidance","evidence_type":"public_health_guidance","evidence_level":"guidance_or_consensus_recommendations_vary_in_certainty","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["scoliosis","screening","school_health","assessment","follow_up"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"学校专业筛查关注脊柱侧弯、前后弯曲异常及姿态问题，发现疑似异常后转至医疗机构确认，并以连续健康档案追踪。","key_points":["体表躯干旋转角 ATR 与影像 Cobb 角属于不同测量；健康姿态教育不能替代结构性侧弯诊疗。"],"applicability":"中国儿童青少年学校筛查、档案与家校医协作。","limitations":"公共卫生技术指南，不能把坐姿问题一概解释为特发性侧弯病因；筛查结果不等同确诊。","keywords":["学校筛查","脊柱弯曲异常","ATR","Cobb","学生健康档案","转诊"],"clinical_questions":["学校筛查发现脊柱弯曲异常后如何转诊和记录？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"china_five_health_2026","title":"五健行动计划：年度脊柱筛查、学生档案与转介","publisher":"国家卫生健康委等13部门（教育部公开）","source_url":"https://www.moe.gov.cn/jyb_xxgk/moe_1777/moe_1779/202603/t20260324_1431885.html","source_date":"2025","source_date_kind":"notice_year","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"public_health_policy","evidence_type":"public_health_policy","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["school_health","screening","follow_up","posture"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"2026—2030 年行动计划将脊柱筛查纳入学生体检与常见病监测，提出学校每年为 10—16 岁学生开展一次筛查评估，将异常者转介医疗机构。","key_points":["学校记录脊柱健康档案，并结合身高变化调整课桌椅与书包使用，支持体育活动。"],"applicability":"中国学校公共卫生流程和家校医协作。","limitations":"政策实施要求不是无症状筛查净获益的临床试验证明；学校筛查不等于每年统一拍片。","keywords":["五健","学校筛查","学生档案","年度体检","转介","课桌椅"],"clinical_questions":["五健计划对学校脊柱筛查和转介有什么要求？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"ndc_multidisease_2024","title":"学生常见病多病共防：环境、行为与动态监测","publisher":"国家疾病预防控制局","source_url":"https://www.ndcpa.gov.cn/jbkzzx/c100014/common/content/content_1787407022636773376.html","source_date":"2024-05-06","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"public_health_guidance","evidence_type":"public_health_guidance","evidence_level":"guidance_or_consensus_recommendations_vary_in_certainty","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["school_health","posture","physical_activity","follow_up"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"学生常见病多病共防指南从身体活动、久坐、睡眠及家庭学校环境等共同因素组织健康促进，结合监测结果开展干预、复查和转诊。","key_points":["学校与家庭可共同改善课桌椅适配、活动机会和健康行为记录。"],"applicability":"中国学校脊柱健康与其他学生常见病协同管理。","limitations":"多病共同风险因素不代表每一种行为都会导致特发性侧弯；不提供个体矫形处方。","keywords":["多病共防","学生常见病","课桌椅","久坐","学校健康","动态监测"],"clinical_questions":["学校怎样把姿态、活动和复查纳入多病共防？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"reviewed_source_page_text","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"cma_spine_anatomy","title":"认识脊柱：生理曲度、椎间盘与神经保护","publisher":"中华医学会神经外科学分会","source_url":"https://cns.cma.org.cn/art/2020/6/8/art_3024_34809.html","source_date":"2020-06-08","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["anatomy","posture","spine"],"populations":["all"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"脊柱由椎骨及连接它们的关节、椎间盘和韧带组成；颈腰段与胸骶段的生理曲度协同承担支撑、活动和神经保护功能。","key_points":["解剖结构、正常生理曲度和疾病造成的结构改变需要分别理解。"],"applicability":"医生解释脊柱结构、家庭理解影像和姿态概念。","limitations":"仅索引该科普的基础解剖信息，不将泛化寝具或保健建议转为治疗处方。","keywords":["脊柱结构","椎骨","椎间盘","生理曲度","前凸","后凸","脊髓"],"clinical_questions":["脊柱为什么有生理弯曲，椎间盘和脊髓分别做什么？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"reviewed_source_page_text","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"cma_rehab_scoliosis","title":"科学认识侧弯康复与三维自我矫正","publisher":"中华医学会物理医学与康复学分会","source_url":"https://cspmr.cma.org.cn/cn/news.asp?id=867.html","source_date":"2023-05-23","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["scoliosis","rehabilitation","exercise","assessment"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"侧弯康复科普介绍外观检查线索和观察、特异性运动、支具及手术等方案，强调根据年龄、类型和严重程度选择，并将三维自我矫正融入生活。","key_points":["PSSE 包括姿态自我矫正、稳定与呼吸等内容，应由专业人员评估指导。"],"applicability":"中文家庭教育与康复沟通。","limitations":"患者教育材料，非临床指南；运动不能普遍替代支具或手术，不据此承诺纠正角度。","keywords":["三维自我矫正","PSSE","侧弯康复","呼吸训练","康复运动"],"clinical_questions":["侧弯特异性康复运动与普通体操有什么区别？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"reviewed_source_page_text","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"hk_student_scoliosis","title":"学生脊柱侧弯：发现线索与生活习惯误区","publisher":"香港卫生署学生健康服务","source_url":"https://www.studenthealth.gov.hk/sc_chi/health/health_bsh/health_bsh_sco.html","source_date":"2022-06","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["scoliosis","screening","posture","follow_up"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"高低肩、肩胛骨或腰部不对称可提示需要检查；侧弯进展与骨骼成熟度和曲线程度有关。日常健康习惯有益整体健康，但不等于可预防特发性侧弯。","key_points":["轻度曲线也应按医生建议观察，严重情况需要骨科评估。"],"applicability":"学生及家长理解姿态观察、随访与病因不确定性。","limitations":"页面对生活习惯的说明不能用来否定已确诊患者接受专业 PSSE 的可能价值；科普不提供个体疗效预测。","keywords":["高低肩","坐姿病因","生活习惯","学生脊柱","原发性侧弯","骨骼成熟"],"clinical_questions":["孩子侧弯是不是坐姿不好造成，轻度还用复查吗？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"nice_ng65","title":"炎性腰背痛与脊柱关节炎识别转诊","publisher":"NICE","source_url":"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/NG65/chapter/Recommendations","source_date":"2017","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"clinical_guideline","evidence_type":"clinical_guideline","evidence_level":"guidance_or_consensus_recommendations_vary_in_certainty","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["back_pain","red_flags","assessment","rehabilitation"],"populations":["adult"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"年轻起病且持续的腰背痛若伴夜间痛、活动改善、银屑病或葡萄膜炎等线索，应考虑脊柱关节炎评估；单个体征或阴性检查不能独立排除。","key_points":["疑似炎性疾病需要综合病史、检查与专科转诊，避免只按机械性腰痛处理。"],"applicability":"16 岁以上疑似脊柱关节炎的专业识别和转诊参考。","limitations":"所索引为识别原则，不复刻完整转诊算法；本库 adult 标签是检索分类，原指南范围为16岁以上。","keywords":["炎性腰背痛","晨僵","夜间痛","脊柱关节炎","银屑病","葡萄膜炎"],"clinical_questions":["腰背痛夜里明显、活动好转，是否要考虑炎性疾病？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"nice_ng234","title":"肿瘤患者新发步态障碍：警惕脊髓压迫","publisher":"NICE","source_url":"https://www.nice.org.uk/guidance/ng234/resources/metastatic-spinal-cord-compression-initial-assessment-and-management-pdf-13134700768","source_date":"2023","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"guideline_summary","evidence_type":"guideline_summary","evidence_level":"guidance_or_consensus_recommendations_vary_in_certainty","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["red_flags","gait","imaging","back_pain"],"populations":["adult"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"有肿瘤病史的人若出现行走困难、肢体无力、感觉变化或膀胱肠道障碍，应立即评估可能的转移性脊髓压迫；这属于急诊路径，不能等待视频步态结果。","key_points":["疑似压迫的影像与处置由急诊或专科团队尽快安排，并同步评估支持和康复需求。"],"applicability":"肿瘤背景下新发神经症状和步态异常的识别。","limitations":"仅索引 NICE 初始评估摘要；不包含药物剂量，不把所有背痛判断为肿瘤。","keywords":["肿瘤","脊髓压迫","癌症","行走困难","肢体无力","转移"],"clinical_questions":["有癌症病史最近走路困难，应先做步态视频还是及时就诊？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"radiology_child_safety","title":"儿童影像辐射：必要性、既往检查与剂量适配","publisher":"ACR/RSNA RadiologyInfo","source_url":"https://www.radiologyinfo.org/en/info/safety-rad-children","source_date":"2024-08-25","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["imaging","radiation","shared_decision"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"儿童影像选择应平衡诊断价值与潜在风险，检查前可核对既往影像是否足够、是否有适用的无电离辐射替代方法，以及设备参数是否适配儿童体型。","key_points":["携带已有影像和报告有助避免不必要重复检查。"],"applicability":"家长与医生沟通儿童影像检查必要性。","limitations":"MRI、超声和 X 线各有适应证，不能仅因辐射担忧就自行替代或取消有指征检查。","keywords":["儿童辐射","重复拍片","影像剂量","既往影像","儿童X线"],"clinical_questions":["儿童反复拍片怎么办，可以带旧片避免重复吗？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"aaos_pars","title":"青少年腰痛的其他原因：峡部裂与椎体滑脱","publisher":"AAOS OrthoInfo","source_url":"https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/spondylolysis-and-spondylolisthesis/","source_date":null,"source_date_kind":"not_stated_in_reviewed_text","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["back_pain","differential_diagnosis","imaging","rehabilitation"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"峡部裂是椎弓峡部的薄弱或应力骨折，椎体滑脱指椎骨向前移位；青少年反复腰椎过伸运动相关腰痛需要病史、查体和必要影像鉴别。","key_points":["部分患者有活动痛、腘绳肌紧张或僵硬步态，治疗与复查依症状和滑脱情况选择。"],"applicability":"青少年运动性腰痛、步态僵硬的鉴别教育。","limitations":"不将所有运动后腰痛归于峡部裂，也不以步态模型判断骨折或滑脱等级。","keywords":["峡部裂","椎体滑脱","过伸","运动腰痛","应力骨折","僵硬步态"],"clinical_questions":["运动后腰痛且走路僵硬会不会不只是侧弯？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"aaos_adult_slip","title":"成人腰椎滑脱：退变、神经症状与评估","publisher":"AAOS OrthoInfo","source_url":"https://www.orthoinfo.org/diseases--conditions/adult-spondylolisthesis-in-the-low-back","source_date":null,"source_date_kind":"not_stated_in_reviewed_text","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["back_pain","differential_diagnosis","spine","assessment"],"populations":["adult","older_adult"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"腰椎滑脱可与退变或既往峡部缺损有关；有些人没有症状，另一些人表现为腰痛或腿痛，需要结合症状和影像判断其临床意义。","key_points":["椎间盘和关节退变可能影响稳定性，但单个影像发现不能解释所有疼痛。"],"applicability":"成人腰腿痛及影像提示滑脱的理解。","limitations":"患者教育资料，不提供手术适应证自动判定；不同病因和滑脱程度不能共用单一处方。","keywords":["成人滑脱","腰椎滑脱","退变","峡部缺损","腰腿痛"],"clinical_questions":["成人影像发现腰椎滑脱一定会疼或一定要手术吗？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"srs_radiographic_manual","title":"脊柱影像测量：Cobb 之外的平衡与旋转","publisher":"SRS/SDSG","source_url":"https://www.srs.org/Files/Research/Manuals-and-Publications/sdsg-radiographic-measuremnt-manual.pdf","source_date":null,"source_date_kind":"not_stated_in_reviewed_text","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"measurement_manual","evidence_type":"measurement_manual","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["imaging","measurement","anatomy","spine"],"populations":["all"],"audiences":["doctor"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"脊柱畸形测量手册强调 Cobb 角不能概括全部畸形，还应区分冠状与矢状平衡、椎体旋转、端椎选择及骨盆相关参数，并保证影像体位和质量。","key_points":["一致的术语、椎体编号与拍摄条件有助不同医生和时间点交流，但部分区域测量重复性有限。"],"applicability":"影像测量字段设计、人工复核与随访报告解释。","limitations":"本条仅摘要所查阅的手册前言及范围，不等于实现或校验整套测量算法；不索引手册图像。","keywords":["影像测量","冠状平衡","矢状平衡","端椎","骨盆参数","椎体旋转"],"clinical_questions":["Cobb角之外还需要看哪些脊柱平衡和旋转参数？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"acr_scoliosis_radiography","title":"儿童侧弯摄片规范：体位、视野与临床信息","publisher":"ACR/SPR/SSR","source_url":"https://gravitas.acr.org/PPTS/DownloadPreviewDocument?DocId=44","source_date":null,"source_date_kind":"not_stated_in_reviewed_text","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"practice_parameter","evidence_type":"practice_parameter","evidence_level":"guidance_or_consensus_recommendations_vary_in_certainty","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["imaging","measurement","radiation","follow_up"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"儿童侧弯 X 线应有明确医学理由，在诊断质量前提下控制剂量；摄片数量和体位依临床问题选择，并向影像医生提供病史、症状及随访目的。","key_points":["站立后前位可降低部分组织剂量，不能站立者需适当替代体位；侧位有助矢状畸形和平衡评估。"],"applicability":"影像采集说明、拍摄条件记录和跨次比较。","limitations":"网页为官方实践参数预览，所查文字未明确版本日期；不把所有患者固定为同一拍摄频次。","keywords":["摄片规范","站立位","后前位","影像视野","拍摄体位","矢状评估"],"clinical_questions":["全脊柱片拍摄体位和视野为什么影响比较？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"sosort_radiation_2012","title":"侧弯随访减少 X 线暴露的共识原则","publisher":"SOSORT","source_url":"https://pmc.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/articles/PMC4002921/","source_date":"2014-04-25","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"expert_consensus","evidence_type":"expert_consensus","evidence_level":"guidance_or_consensus_recommendations_vary_in_certainty","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["radiation","imaging","follow_up","scoliosis"],"populations":["child","adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"SOSORT 共识建议结合生长成熟度、体表变化和病情制定临床与影像随访，优先用查体等发现进展线索，并考虑后前位等减少照射的方法。","key_points":["临床复诊间隔和拍片间隔是两个不同概念，重复侧位或 CT 不应自动成为常规。"],"applicability":"理解长期侧弯随访中的剂量管理。","limitations":"2012 年形成、2014 年发表的专家共识，不能取代更新的本地规范和个体临床判断；未把旧间隔直接设为软件规则。","keywords":["减少辐射","拍片间隔","临床复诊","后前位","随访影像"],"clinical_questions":["侧弯复诊是否每次都需要重新拍正侧位？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"CC-BY-4.0 (article); summary only","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"schreiber_schroth_rct_2016","title":"施罗斯运动联合常规照护的随机试验证据","publisher":"Schreiber et al./PLOS ONE","source_url":"https://journals.plos.org/plosone/article?id=10.1371%2Fjournal.pone.0168746","source_date":"2016-12-29","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"randomized_trial","evidence_type":"randomized_trial","evidence_level":"individual_randomized_trial_not_formally_graded_here","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["rehabilitation","exercise","scoliosis","evidence"],"populations":["adolescent"],"audiences":["doctor"],"usage":["clinical_reference","research_reference"],"summary":"一项 50 人、六个月的随机试验比较了施罗斯 PSSE 联合常规照护与单纯常规照护，前者在平均曲线变化上更有利，提供短期辅助治疗证据。","key_points":["研究包含专业监督及家庭练习，干预是在观察或支具等照护基础上增加运动。"],"applicability":"讨论青少年特发性侧弯 PSSE 证据与研究局限。","limitations":"小样本、单中心及短期随访，不能外推个人改善角度、长期免手术获益或成人疗效。","keywords":["施罗斯","Schroth","随机试验","PSSE","运动疗效"],"clinical_questions":["施罗斯运动有随机试验证据吗，能保证角度下降吗？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"Creative Commons Attribution (article notice); summary only","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"gstt_postop_recovery","title":"腰椎减压或椎间盘切除术后的活动与随访","publisher":"Guy's and St Thomas' NHS Foundation Trust","source_url":"https://www.guysandstthomas.nhs.uk/health-information/recovering-lumbar-spine-decompression-or-discectomy","source_date":"2026-07","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["postoperative","rehabilitation","follow_up","red_flags"],"populations":["adult"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"腰椎减压或椎间盘切除后应在团队指导下逐步恢复步行，出院时明确药物、联系渠道及复诊时间；恢复速度因人而异。","key_points":["伤口红肿渗出或发热需联系医疗人员；新发显著神经症状或排尿困难需及时急诊评估。"],"applicability":"该类手术后早期家庭照护与复查教育。","limitations":"医院患者资料针对特定手术，不可将其活动时程直接用于侧弯融合、骨折或其他术式。","keywords":["术后康复","腰椎减压","椎间盘切除","伤口","出院随访"],"clinical_questions":["腰椎减压术后回家怎样逐步走路并安排复查？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"reviewed_source_page_text","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"cdc_four_stage_balance","title":"四阶段平衡测试：静态平衡与停止条件","publisher":"CDC STEADI","source_url":"https://www.cdc.gov/steadi/media/pdfs/STEADI-Assessment-4Stage-508.pdf","source_date":"2017","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"assessment_protocol","evidence_type":"assessment_protocol","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["gait","balance","falls","assessment"],"populations":["older_adult"],"audiences":["doctor"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"四阶段测试以逐渐变难的站姿评估静态平衡，由评估者示范并在旁保护；不能按协议保持某一阶段时停止，避免继续挑战。","key_points":["结果用于发现平衡问题并考虑进一步评估或训练，不应当作个体跌倒概率。"],"applicability":"受训人员进行老年静态平衡评估。","limitations":"有安全保护与明确测试条件，不能从任意步行视频补算成绩，也不建议无人保护时自行尝试。","keywords":["四阶段平衡","静态平衡","串联站立","停止条件","跌倒评估"],"clinical_questions":["四阶段平衡测试什么时候应该停止？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"reviewed_source_pdf_text","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"cdc_chair_stand","title":"30 秒坐站测试：下肢力量与耐力","publisher":"CDC STEADI","source_url":"https://www.cdc.gov/steadi/media/pdfs/STEADI-Assessment-30Sec-508.pdf","source_date":"2017","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"assessment_protocol","evidence_type":"assessment_protocol","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["gait","strength","falls","assessment"],"populations":["older_adult"],"audiences":["doctor"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"30 秒坐站测试在规定座椅和姿势下记录完整起立次数，用来评估下肢力量与耐力；施测者应在旁保护，无法遵循姿势要求时按协议停止和记录。","key_points":["年龄相关参考值来自规定人群和施测方法，记录座椅、辅助及未完成情况很重要。"],"applicability":"受训人员开展老年功能评估与纵向比较。","limitations":"普通视频缺少规定时间、座椅与动作条件时不能生成该量表成绩；不复制原表格或将单项成绩当作诊断。","keywords":["30秒坐站","下肢力量","起立次数","肌肉耐力","座椅高度"],"clinical_questions":["30秒坐站测试测什么，普通走路视频能得出这个成绩吗？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"who_assistive_technology","title":"辅助技术与康复：促进活动和日常参与","publisher":"WHO","source_url":"https://www.who.int/news-room/fact-sheets/detail/assistive-technology","source_date":"2024-01-02","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"fact_sheet","evidence_type":"fact_sheet","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["rehabilitation","assistive_technology","function"],"populations":["all"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"辅助技术包含产品及配套服务，可支持移动、自理和日常参与；合理服务应考虑使用者与家庭的需求，并支持长期安全有效使用。","key_points":["辅助产品可能短期或长期使用，其价值不仅在行走速度，也在独立性和生活参与。"],"applicability":"康复目标沟通、辅助产品需求评估。","limitations":"宏观健康资料，不根据步态视频自动推荐具体助行器型号或矫形器参数。","keywords":["辅助技术","助行器","轮椅","独立生活","日常参与"],"clinical_questions":["康复为什么也要关注助行器和日常生活参与？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"indexed_source_excerpt","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
{"id":"niams_osteoporosis","title":"骨质疏松、身高下降与脊柱骨折线索","publisher":"NIAMS","source_url":"https://www.niams.nih.gov/health-topics/osteoporosis","source_date":"2022-12","source_date_kind":"publication_or_page_review","retrieved_at":"2026-09-08","source_type":"patient_education","evidence_type":"patient_education","evidence_level":"educational_or_implementation_material_not_formally_graded","evidence_kind":"knowledge","topics":["bone_health","fracture","red_flags","posture"],"populations":["adult","older_adult"],"audiences":["doctor","family"],"usage":["education","clinical_reference"],"summary":"骨质疏松可能在骨折前没有明显症状；脊柱骨折可表现为新发背痛、身高下降或后凸，风险评估应同时考虑年龄、既往骨折、疾病及药物等。","key_points":["轻微跌倒或日常负荷也可能造成脆性骨折，体态变化需要结合病史评估。"],"applicability":"成人尤其老年人的骨健康与姿态变化教育。","limitations":"不能仅凭驼背、步态或摄像头姿态诊断骨质疏松，也不提供骨密度或骨折风险的自动推算。","keywords":["骨质疏松","身高下降","脆性骨折","驼背","骨健康"],"clinical_questions":["老人身高变矮和驼背是否需要考虑脊柱骨折？"],"access_mode":"summary_only","full_text_indexed":false,"retrieval_method":"reviewed_source_page_text","source_license":"not_relicensed; original source rights retained","license_note":"仅保存自行撰写的简短事实摘要、元数据与出处链接；不复制原文全文、图片或量表。未把公开可读等同于允许全文再分发。","clinically_signed_off":false}
